## SQ-BBQ-01 | Barbeque's Delight member loads, no recipe or compost warning
@group A
@commands Boot; `grep -n "barbequesdelight" logs/latest.log \| grep -i "error\|exception\|failed to parse\|missing" \| head`; `grep -n "barbequesdelight\|bbq" logs/kubejs/server.log logs/kubejs/startup.log \| grep -i "warn\|error" \| head`
@pass mod `barbequesdelight` loads from the CD jar (`creativedelight_members.txt`); no recipe parse errors; no NCH warning for the 26 recipes; no compost warning for the 24 rows
@fails `CampfireRainInfo` missing (patcherMod old); an unknown item key in `recipes.js`
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb passed
bootexpect \[creativedelight\] members: \[.*\bbarbequesdelight\b
bootreject (?i)barbequesdelight.*(exception|failed to parse|missing)
kjsreject (?i)(warn|error).*(barbequesdelight|bbqSkewering|bbqGrilling|bbqCombine)
shell grep -hn "barbequesdelight\|bbq" logs/kubejs/server.log logs/kubejs/startup.log | grep -i "warn\|error" | head; true

