## SQ-BBQ-05 | grill on a campfire: lights, goes out in rain on stone, stays lit on coal (212 stone, 216 coal block)
@group A
@commands Bot: place a grill on a placed campfire (`/setblock` campfire then use the grill item on it); `/data get block` / block state; `/setblock ~ ~-1 ~ minecraft:stone`, `/weather rain`, light it with flint and steel, wait 200 ticks; repeat on `minecraft:coal_block`
@pass state `has_campfire=true,lit=false` on placing; lit by flint and steel (light 15); out in rain after `rainOutTicks` (160) on stone; still lit on the coal block; breaking drops the grill and a campfire
@fails rain rule: grill not in `rain_douses`, or Creative Compat not filling CampfireRainInfo
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
> setblock 212 -61 500 minecraft:stone
> setblock 216 -61 500 minecraft:coal_block
> setblock 212 -60 500 minecraft:campfire[lit=false]
> setblock 216 -60 500 minecraft:campfire[lit=false]
> pbot spawn bbq5 214 -60 503 minecraft:overworld survival
> pbot hold bbq5 barbequesdelight:grill
> pbot use bbq5 212 -60 500 up
> pbot hold bbq5 barbequesdelight:grill
> pbot use bbq5 216 -60 500 up
> execute if block 212 -60 500 barbequesdelight:grill[has_campfire=true,lit=false] run say BBQ05 grill on campfire 212
> execute if block 216 -60 500 barbequesdelight:grill[has_campfire=true,lit=false] run say BBQ05 grill on campfire 216
> pbot hold bbq5 minecraft:flint_and_steel
> pbot use bbq5 212 -60 500 up
> pbot hold bbq5 minecraft:flint_and_steel
> pbot use bbq5 216 -60 500 up
> execute if block 212 -60 500 barbequesdelight:grill[lit=true] run say BBQ05 lit 212
> execute if block 216 -60 500 barbequesdelight:grill[lit=true] run say BBQ05 lit 216
> weather rain 600
sleep 15
> execute if block 212 -60 500 barbequesdelight:grill[lit=false] run say BBQ05 out in rain on stone
> execute if block 216 -60 500 barbequesdelight:grill[lit=true] run say BBQ05 still lit on coal
> weather clear 100000
> zact break 212 -60 500 none
expect BBQ05 grill on campfire 212
expect BBQ05 grill on campfire 216
expect BBQ05 lit 212
expect BBQ05 lit 216
expect BBQ05 out in rain on stone
expect BBQ05 still lit on coal
expect \[zact\] break 212 -60 500 barbequesdelight:grill held none: true, .*drops barbequesdelight:grill x1, minecraft:campfire x1
> pbot remove bbq5
look if the grill landed one block up (y -59) instead of replacing the campfire, the execute lines are silent: check `data get block` / zq count by hand; light level 15 is not probed

